ring in advance"}]," — ","Have 5-8 STAR stories ready before your interview."]}]]}]]}]]}]
15:["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"Tips for Non-Native English Speakers"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent mt-0.5","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neutral-700","children":"Use simple, direct language. You don't need fancy vocabulary to give a great STAR answer."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent mt-0.5","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neutral-700","children":"Practice out loud. Writing is different from speaking — rehearse your answers verbally."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent mt-0.5","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neutral-700","children":"Use our AI feedback tool. It highlights unnatural phrasing and suggests clearer alternatives."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent mt-0.5","children":"✓"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neutral-700","children":"Learn key transitions. Phrases like \"The situation was...\", \"My role was...\", \"I decided to...\", \"As a result...\" make your answer flow naturally."}]]}]]}]]}]
